{"data": [{"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T05:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116409662635692138"], "id": "2116409662635692138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 30244, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116405414921384099", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tibo 终于熬完他的 28 天了，最后两天送重置卡👍 https://t.co/aiwXfiahQS", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116409662635692138"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116366099851739136"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:07:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116366460939386990"], "id": "2116366460939386990", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 20990, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 87, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116304098228068572", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "疑似造假：有人称偷到 Claude Fable 5 权重在兜售，网友比对发现文件来自 DeepSeek 免费开源的模型\n\n网上有人在兜售所谓 Anthropic 旗舰模型 Claude Fable 5 的“权重”。这个说法没有证实，已有网友指出是假的：卖家晒出的文件，和 DeepSeek 免费公开下载的模型文件一个字节都不差。截至北京时间 31 https://t.co/lqqJFBQVJo https://t.co/8SiVR1GQSZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116366460939386990"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:59:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116364406871441755"], "id": "2116364406871441755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3341, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116201052437717175", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2114929079975563269", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "作者的 X 账号，推荐关注\nhttps://t.co/EeI2bpiEZa", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116364406871441755"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116348664473911296", "3_2116348908473307136", "3_2116349115114074112", "3_2116349274736709632"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:59:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116349344714473839"], "id": "2116349344714473839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 5473, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116339235443847533", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "用 DeepSeek 4.1 Flash 模型做出来的效果也不错 https://t.co/0Pbf9X1d1E", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116349344714473839"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116339235443847533"], "id": "2116339235443847533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7421, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116336030584574076", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "写一个 dsh plugin 比我想的要简单一点，把官方文档给 Opus 5.5，提出我的要求就可以完成了：https://t.co/pMTvvTsTZr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116339235443847533"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116335546905624577"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:06:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116336030584574076"], "id": "2116336030584574076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 586, "impression_count": 44510, "like_count": 567, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 101, "retweet_count": 71}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116060639533969759", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "做了一个 DeepSeek Harness 插件，现在 Claude Design 可以运行在 DeepSeek Harness，并且可以方便的标注、评论修改。 \n\nDeepSee Harness 确实越来越优秀了👍 @tianyi \n\n插件地址：https://t.co/5aOb2IXJMa https://t.co/BteewRJLfR https://t.co/BdEr23waTh", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116336030584574076"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:00:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116334522748809566"], "id": "2116334522748809566", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 7288, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 48, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116329479803187508", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Max 20x 一直是 pro x10 倍用量，所谓的 20x 是每 5 小时限额是 pro 的 x20 倍。 https://t.co/b0ipd4xXJR", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116334522748809566"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116258680131760128"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:59:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116258713187312073"], "id": "2116258713187312073", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 8923, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个小技巧，很多公司的网页在线客服，默认都是那种 Q&amp;A 的问答，就是默认一些选项让你选择，实际上得不到有效的回复，因为背后不是真人，这时候你可以试试输入“live agent”，那么会帮你转接真人客服。 https://t.co/7bEDPz5YPZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116258713187312073"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116238859633635328"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T18:41:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116239092312846483"], "id": "2116239092312846483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3551, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116219345215074538", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116219659544399897", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "更多内容\n\nhttps://t.co/DRTXBLNRyL https://t.co/Pn6Bl0iyMr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116239092312846483"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116233556649299968"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T18:19:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116232599681286596", "2116233564823974005"], "id": "2116233564823974005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 38301, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 49, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116220869479428500", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude 200 美元档改名 Ultra，已验证账号取消 5 小时限额，价格和周额度不变\n\nAnthropic 10 月 30 日宣布给 Claude 的两档 Max 套餐改名：每月 100 美元的 Max 5x 改叫 Max，每月 200 美元的 Max 20x 改叫 Ultra。价格不变，现有订阅自动换成新名字，用户什么都不用做。\n\n同时，Ultra https://t.co/tu0yTHKvqT https://t.co/hd5BSD26Yc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116233564823974005"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:24:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116219659544399897"], "id": "2116219659544399897", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 22536, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116214866444943853", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Google 太空 AI 芯片第一次答题：卫星发射一个月后，在轨道上写了一首俳句\n\nGoogle 放在卫星上的 AI 芯片，第一次在太空里完成了一次完整的提问和回答。Google CEO Sundar Pichai 10 月 30 日发推说，团队从地面把指令发到轨道，启动 TPU，跑完提示词，收回了第一份完整回复：一首俳句。\n\n这颗卫星属于 https://t.co/9ZSxkOyCSp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116219659544399897"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116218535999315968"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:19:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116218281509913087", "2116218545906319826"], "id": "2116218545906319826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 169, "impression_count": 78211, "like_count": 207, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 87, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "思科总裁给一名 27 岁员工不限量用 AI，目标两年内重写公司 98% 的老代码\n\n思科（Cisco）总裁兼首席产品官 Jeetu Patel，把公司最大的工程之一交给了一个 27 岁的年轻人。这件事是他在 Fortune 组织的一场小型晚宴上讲的。\n\n这个年轻人叫 Padmanabhan Krishnamurthy，Patel 叫他 Paddy。Paddy 2023 https://t.co/OJDcq3pp3d", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116218545906319826"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:47:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116180142036828484"], "id": "2116180142036828484", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 15493, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116094255588655140", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "把它当成本地可以作为 skill 运行的 Claude design 就好\n\n主要是为了避免下架所以我改名了下，因为之前很多 claude code 命名的项目都被下架了，包括 Clawdbot 都要改名 openclaw。 https://t.co/KwCNoyINAx", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116180142036828484"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116059461085184000"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:52:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116060639533969759"], "id": "2116060639533969759", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 122, "impression_count": 61541, "like_count": 150, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 76, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115667965328977920", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "baoyu-design v2.1 加上了评论功能，现在可以在设计的页面、slides 上标记元素并添加评论，Agent 可以读取你的评论，并且还可以回复你的评论。\n\n所有评论数据都和项目数据保存在一起，成为你项目数据资产的一部分。\n\nhttps://t.co/POuwOWT2lM https://t.co/zAlJ66CaQN https://t.co/Bn2gToUddC", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116060639533969759"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:21:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116037666655678688"], "id": "2116037666655678688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 6131, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116035459243737139", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116026448234332315", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这一点确实，如果 cache 过期了去压缩，要付出很大的压缩成本\n\nhttps://t.co/35z0P7DDb8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116037666655678688"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:36:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116026448234332315"], "id": "2116026448234332315", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 28925, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 95, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115842962521509968", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "如果我理解的没错的话，当前 Claude Code 在压缩后继续任务，会按需从历史会话中查找有用的信息加载到上下文。\n\n这和作者所说的新开一个会话再去从原来的会话加载有用信息不是一回事吗？唯一的差别就是多了一点摘要信息，但这多不了多少 Token。 https://t.co/F5NKblcfze", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116026448234332315"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:47:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115968852349567254"], "id": "2115968852349567254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 17429, "like_count": 55, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 107, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115923971279614171", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude API 单次请求上限从 32 MB 提到 128 MB，长时间截图任务和大 PDF 不容易再卡住，只限 Anthropic 官方 API\n\nAnthropic 把 Claude API 单次请求能发送的数据量上限，从 32 MB 提高到 128 MB，大约是原来的 4 倍。调整的是 Messages（调用模型的主接口）和 Token Counting（发送前估算 token https://t.co/q2qX4z1WEW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115968852349567254"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:46:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923359149998490"], "id": "2115923359149998490", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 77, "impression_count": 39941, "like_count": 120, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 73, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115871889549865429", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude 现在会在每次回答后自查对话安不安全：算力 Anthropic 出、不向用户收费，不额外收集数据，自称单条标记不会直接导致封号\n\n似乎更多是为了防止蒸馏？\n\nAnthropic 公布了一项叫“自我评估”（self-assessment）的防滥用技术：Claude https://t.co/2agu20QP5G", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115923359149998490"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:20:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115856411439575386"], "id": "2115856411439575386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 45, "impression_count": 63824, "like_count": 134, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 77, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115850175868727621", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI 即日起把 ChatGPT Pro 各档和 Business Premium 的用量上限翻倍，原定明天的 Pro 200 降额取消，价格没提变化\n\nTibo 说，Pro 100、Pro 200、Pro 500 三档和 Business Premium 的所有用量上限翻倍，当天生效。Plus 不在名单里。\n\n【我现在能用多少】\n\n按 OpenAI 此前公布的倍数推算（以 Plus 为 https://t.co/EMZSWX1eZY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115856411439575386"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115844485506847147"], "id": "2115844485506847147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7930, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115842646031642966", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "然后每天大量和 Alexa 语音对话，这种语音设备还是对孩子更友好，家长也放心一些。\n\n十万个为什么，各种问题去问 AI，每次对话完还礼貌的说一句: \"Thank you Alexa, bye\"。\n\n相比而言，他更相信 AI 给的答案更甚于爸爸妈妈给的答案。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115844485506847147"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115840999863787520", "3_2115842090043047937", "3_2115842214878199808"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:26:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115842646031642966"], "id": "2115842646031642966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 105, "impression_count": 60106, "like_count": 308, "quote_count": 18, "reply_count": 102, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "我 7 岁的孩子都学会自己在 ChatGPT 做游戏了\n\n看了下他和 ChatGPT 的聊天记录，开始只是好玩画图，然后想生成视频，后来想能不能做成游戏，游戏做好了就一边玩一边让 ChatGPT 按照自己要求改，乐此不疲。\n\n不太会打字，都靠语音输入。 https://t.co/oBWkN6D2BX", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115842646031642966"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:10:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115808563406708826"], "id": "2115808563406708826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 5919, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109151666020794711", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2115806466825453782", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "前端逆向方法\nhttps://t.co/6sXlL977LH", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115808563406708826"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115805746130472960", "3_2115806249333698560"]}, "author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:02:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115806466825453782"], "id": "2115806466825453782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 7583, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115719451081601251", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2115671624280420856", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "忘记说了，直接升级不行，需要用新的 skills 名字：\n\nclaude-design-system （设计系统，不要省，做设计先用它导入或者制作好设计系统）\nclaude-design（对应 Design）\nclaude-slides（对应 Slides）\nclaude-dashboard（对应 Dashboard）\n\nhttps://t.co/18MuAuQUPB https://t.co/iFY2o51BqV", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115806466825453782"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116366099851739136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116348664473911296", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116348908473307136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116349115114074112", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116349274736709632", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116335546905624577", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116258680131760128", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116238859633635328", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116233556649299968", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116218535999315968", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116059461085184000", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115840999863787520", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115842090043047937", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115842214878199808", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115805746130472960", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115806249333698560", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116409662635692138", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g785g03wvtl19fe7vvawu3lxki", "oldest_id": "2115806466825453782", "result_count": 23}}